Improper Input Validation and Injection User inputs for messages and usernames are not validated or sanitized, which can lead to SQL injection and other injection attacks., Insecure Direct Object References The application may expose direct access to database records without proper authorization checks, allowing users to access or manipulate messages they shouldn't.

